    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but what if there isn't a next chapter? i keep waiting for that feeling to come back, that drive, but it feels like it's just gone for good. like the well is dry. it's exhausting trying to pretend there's more to say when the truth is that i have nothing left to give. it feels more like a conclusion than a pause.",
